  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring the safety and well-being of crisis-affected children through child protection services and GBV prevention interventions in Bamabsi Woreda, Benishangul-Gumuz Region._x000d_
_x000d_
This project will target internally displaced persons (IDPs) residing in two IDP camps located within Bamabsi woreda, Benishangul-Gumuz Region. The project aims to provide child protection services for displaced and emergency-affected children including psycho-social support, case management and referrals._x000d_</narrative>
  </description>
